49	 * Dynamically imports a module with TypeScript support, falling back to require if necessary.
50	 *
51	 * @example Import a TypeScript preset
52	 *
53	 * ```ts
54	 * const preset = await importModule('./my-preset.ts');
55	 * // Returns the default export or the entire module
56	 * ```
