107	 *
108	 * Optionally pass in a list of file extensions to try, defaulting to `.mjs`, `.js`, and `.cjs`.
109	 *
110	 * @example
111	 *
112	 * ```typescript
113	 * // Resolve a relative module
114	 * const path = safeResolveModule({
115	 *   specifier: './utils',
116	 *   parent: import.meta.url,
